name 'building-data-driven-systems-postassessment-q7_2025'

question 'Which of the following best represents "Object Properties" being used to address a specific user need?'

wrong 'Using an array to store a list of names.'
right 'Adding a `low_vision_mode: true` property to a user\'s settings object to trigger high-contrast styles.'
wrong 'Using a variable to store the total number of users.'
wrong 'Naming a function `calculateTotal()` to show the price of a cart.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 4

Object properties are used to model specific attributes of an entity. Adding a property like `low_vision_mode` directly serves a specific user accessibility need.
MARKDOWN
